EVT1105 TEXT x.ChatFrame.Chat7 [H] - I'm sorry, but I cant promise you something that may very well be impossible. It really doesn't matter how well our plan may be going if it only takes one mistake for all of this to come crashing down on us. Just remember that I am doing everything in my power to see this through.
