EVT1108 TEXT x.ChatFrame.Chat1 [H] - Think I would go so far as to say that they might even be the best ones for this job all things considered.
EVT1109 TEXT x.ChatFrame.Chat4 [H] - Its still impossible to say, there's just too many variables to consider. Sure we've hit all of our energy quotas thus far, but the core is starting to destabilize with every activation. At our current rate, this installation might just fall apart long before we have enough power, but I simply do not know.
EVT1110 TEXT x.ChatFrame.Chat2 [H] - I mean, what they've been able to accomplish on such short notice is remarkable to say the least. Even our old crew would struggle with these quotas.
